Cell["A selected TNN becomes hotter, while unused TNNs become colder. Networks that remain unused are purged to release resources. The lifespan fields in Net and the matching and lifecycle hooks in Step provide places to implement this policy; the thresholds and matching rule are deliberately left open.", "Text"]

}, Open]]

}, Open]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["", "SlideShowNavigationBar", CellTags->"SlideShowHeader", CellOpen->False],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Meta Training Pipeline (MTP)", "Section"],

Cell["The MTP bootstraps the generators from known contexts and their associated TNNs. The context bank is the conceptual record of those pairs; currinput and pastinput provide places to retain observations alongside each network.", "Text"],

Cell["Each MNN learns its own part of the network definition: shapes for SNN, activation choices for ANN, weights for WNN, and biases for BNN. A candidate suite is checked with the selection criteria and benchmarked against the current suite on known context–TNN pairs before it is accepted.", "Text"],

